{"n":31,"name":"Luqman","nameAr":"لقمان","meaning":"Luqman","ayahs":34,"place":"makkah","bismillah":true,"ayat":[{"n":1,"juz":21,"ar":"الٓمٓ","en":"Alif, Lām, Meem.","w":[{"ar":"الٓمٓ","tr":"alif-lam-meem","en":"Alif Lam Meem"}]},{"n":2,"juz":21,"ar":"تِلْكَ ءَايَـٰتُ ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ ٱلْحَكِيمِ","en":"These are verses of the wise Book,","w":[{"ar":"تِلْكَ","tr":"til'ka","en":"These"},{"ar":"ءَايَـٰتُ","tr":"āyātu","en":"(are) Verses","root":"أيي","lem":"آيَة"},{"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","tr":"l-kitābi","en":"(of) the Book","root":"كتب","lem":"كِتاب"},{"ar":"ٱلْحَكِيمِ","tr":"l-ḥakīmi","en":"the Wise","root":"حكم","lem":"حَكِيم"}]},{"n":3,"juz":21,"ar":"هُدًى وَرَحْمَةً لِّلْمُحْسِنِينَ","en":"As guidance and mercy for the doers of good","w":[{"ar":"هُدًۭى","tr":"hudan","en":"A guidance","root":"هدي","lem":"هُدًى"},{"ar":"وَرَحْمَةًۭ","tr":"waraḥmatan","en":"and a mercy","root":"رحم","lem":"رَحْمَة"},{"ar":"لِّلْمُحْسِنِينَ","tr":"lil'muḥ'sinīna","en":"for the good-doers","root":"حسن","lem":"مُحْسِن"}]},{"n":4,"juz":21,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ يُقِيمُونَ ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ وَيُؤْتُونَ ٱلزَّكَوٰةَ وَهُم بِٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ هُمْ يُوقِنُونَ","en":"Who establish prayer and give zakāh, and they, of the Hereafter, are certain [in faith].","w":[{"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","tr":"alladhīna","en":"Those who"},{"ar":"يُقِيمُونَ","tr":"yuqīmūna","en":"establish","root":"قوم","lem":"أَقامَ"},{"ar":"ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ","tr":"l-ṣalata","en":"the prayer","root":"صلو","lem":"صَلاة"},{"ar":"وَيُؤْتُونَ","tr":"wayu'tūna","en":"and give","root":"أتي","lem":"آتَى"},{"ar":"ٱلزَّكَوٰةَ","tr":"l-zakata","en":"zakah","root":"زكو","lem":"زَكاة"},{"ar":"وَهُم","tr":"wahum","en":"and they"},{"ar":"بِٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ","tr":"bil-ākhirati","en":"in the Hereafter","root":"أخر","lem":"آخِر"},{"ar":"هُمْ","tr":"hum","en":"[they]"},{"ar":"يُوقِنُونَ","tr":"yūqinūna","en":"believe firmly","root":"يقن","lem":"يُوقِنُ"}]},{"n":5,"juz":21,"ar":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ عَلَىٰ هُدًى مِّن رَّبِّهِمْ ۖ وَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ هُمُ ٱلْمُفْلِحُونَ","en":"Those are on [right] guidance from their Lord, and it is those who are the successful.","w":[{"ar":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","tr":"ulāika","en":"Those"},{"ar":"عَلَىٰ","tr":"ʿalā","en":"(are) on"},{"ar":"هُدًۭى","tr":"hudan","en":"guidance","root":"هدي","lem":"هُدًى"},{"ar":"مِّن","tr":"min","en":"from"},{"ar":"رَّبِّهِمْ ۖ","tr":"rabbihim","en":"their Lord","root":"ربب","lem":"رَبّ"},{"ar":"وَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","tr":"wa-ulāika","en":"and those"},{"ar":"هُمُ","tr":"humu","en":"[they]"},{"ar":"ٱلْمُفْلِحُونَ","tr":"l-muf'liḥūna","en":"(are) the successful","root":"فلح","lem":"مُفْلِح"}]},{"n":6,"juz":21,"ar":"وَمِنَ ٱلنَّاسِ مَن يَشْتَرِى لَهْوَ ٱلْحَدِيثِ لِيُضِلَّ عَن سَبِيلِ ٱللَّهِ بِغَيْرِ عِلْمٍ وَيَتَّخِذَهَا هُزُوًا ۚ أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ لَهُمْ عَذَابٌ مُّهِينٌ","en":"And of the people is he who buys the amusement of speech to mislead [others] from the way of Allāh without knowledge and who takes it [i.e., His way] in ridicule. Those will have a humiliating punishment.","w":[{"ar":"وَمِنَ","tr":"wamina","en":"And of"},{"ar":"ٱلنَّاسِ","tr":"l-nāsi","en":"the mankind","root":"أنس","lem":"ناس"},{"ar":"مَن","tr":"man","en":"(is he) who"},{"ar":"يَشْتَرِى","tr":"yashtarī","en":"purchases","root":"شري","lem":"اشْتَرَى"},{"ar":"لَهْوَ","tr":"lahwa","en":"idle tales","root":"لهو","lem":"لَهْو"},{"ar":"ٱلْحَدِيثِ","tr":"l-ḥadīthi","en":"idle tales","root":"حدث","lem":"حَدِيث"},{"ar":"لِيُضِلَّ","tr":"liyuḍilla","en":"to mislead","root":"ضلل","lem":"أَضَلَّ"},{"ar":"عَن","tr":"ʿan","en":"from"},{"ar":"سَبِيلِ","tr":"sabīli","en":"(the) path","root":"سبل","lem":"سَبِيل"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","tr":"l-lahi","en":"(of) Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"بِغَيْرِ","tr":"bighayri","en":"without","root":"غير","lem":"غَيْر"},{"ar":"عِلْمٍۢ","tr":"ʿil'min","en":"knowledge","root":"علم","lem":"عِلْم"},{"ar":"وَيَتَّخِذَهَا","tr":"wayattakhidhahā","en":"and takes it","root":"أخذ","lem":"اتَّخَذَ"},{"ar":"هُزُوًا ۚ","tr":"huzuwan","en":"(in) ridicule","root":"هزأ","lem":"هُزُو"},{"ar":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","tr":"ulāika","en":"Those"},{"ar":"لَهُمْ","tr":"lahum","en":"for them"},{"ar":"عَذَابٌۭ","tr":"ʿadhābun","en":"(is) a punishment","root":"عذب","lem":"عَذاب"},{"ar":"مُّهِينٌۭ","tr":"muhīnun","en":"humiliating","root":"هون","lem":"مُهِين"}]},{"n":7,"juz":21,"ar":"وَإِذَا تُتْلَىٰ عَلَيْهِ ءَايَـٰتُنَا وَلَّىٰ مُسْتَكْبِرًا كَأَن لَّمْ يَسْمَعْهَا كَأَنَّ فِىٓ أُذُنَيْهِ وَقْرًا ۖ فَبَشِّرْهُ بِعَذَابٍ أَلِيمٍ","en":"And when Our verses are recited to him, he turns away arrogantly as if he had not heard them, as if there was in his ears deafness. So give him tidings of a painful punishment.","w":[{"ar":"وَإِذَا","tr":"wa-idhā","en":"And when"},{"ar":"تُتْلَىٰ","tr":"tut'lā","en":"are recited","root":"تلو","lem":"تَلَى"},{"ar":"عَلَيْهِ","tr":"ʿalayhi","en":"to him"},{"ar":"ءَايَـٰتُنَا","tr":"āyātunā","en":"Our Verses","root":"أيي","lem":"آيَة"},{"ar":"وَلَّىٰ","tr":"wallā","en":"he turns away","root":"ولي","lem":"وَلَّى"},{"ar":"مُسْتَكْبِرًۭا","tr":"mus'takbiran","en":"arrogantly","root":"كبر","lem":"مُسْتَكْبِر"},{"ar":"كَأَن","tr":"ka-an","en":"as if"},{"ar":"لَّمْ","tr":"lam","en":"not"},{"ar":"يَسْمَعْهَا","tr":"yasmaʿhā","en":"he (had) heard them","root":"سمع","lem":"سَمِعَ"},{"ar":"كَأَنَّ","tr":"ka-anna","en":"as if"},{"ar":"فِىٓ","tr":"fī","en":"in"},{"ar":"أُذُنَيْهِ","tr":"udhunayhi","en":"his ears","root":"أذن","lem":"أُذُن"},{"ar":"وَقْرًۭا ۖ","tr":"waqran","en":"(is) deafness","root":"وقر","lem":"وَقْر"},{"ar":"فَبَشِّرْهُ","tr":"fabashir'hu","en":"So give him tidings","root":"بشر","lem":"بُشِّرَ"},{"ar":"بِعَذَابٍ","tr":"biʿadhābin","en":"of a punishment","root":"عذب","lem":"عَذاب"},{"ar":"أَلِيمٍ","tr":"alīmin","en":"painful","root":"ألم","lem":"أَلِيم"}]},{"n":8,"juz":21,"ar":"إِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ وَعَمِلُوا۟ ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ لَهُمْ جَنَّـٰتُ ٱلنَّعِيمِ","en":"Indeed, those who believe and do righteous deeds - for them are the Gardens of Pleasure,","w":[{"ar":"إِنَّ","tr":"inna","en":"Indeed"},{"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","tr":"alladhīna","en":"those who"},{"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","tr":"āmanū","en":"believe","root":"أمن","lem":"آمَنَ"},{"ar":"وَعَمِلُوا۟","tr":"waʿamilū","en":"and do","root":"عمل","lem":"عَمِلَ"},{"ar":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ","tr":"l-ṣāliḥāti","en":"righteous deeds","root":"صلح","lem":"صالِحَة"},{"ar":"لَهُمْ","tr":"lahum","en":"for them"},{"ar":"جَنَّـٰتُ","tr":"jannātu","en":"(are) Gardens","root":"جنن","lem":"جَنَّة"},{"ar":"ٱلنَّعِيمِ","tr":"l-naʿīmi","en":"(of) Delight","root":"نعم","lem":"نَعِيم"}]},{"n":9,"juz":21,"ar":"خَـٰلِدِينَ فِيهَا ۖ وَعْدَ ٱللَّهِ حَقًّا ۚ وَهُوَ ٱلْعَزِيزُ ٱلْحَكِيمُ","en":"Wherein they abide eternally; [it is] the promise of Allāh [which is] truth. And He is the Exalted in Might, the Wise.","w":[{"ar":"خَـٰلِدِينَ","tr":"khālidīna","en":"(To) abide forever","root":"خلد","lem":"خالِد"},{"ar":"فِيهَا ۖ","tr":"fīhā","en":"in it"},{"ar":"وَعْدَ","tr":"waʿda","en":"(The) Promise of Allah","root":"وعد","lem":"وَعْد"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","tr":"l-lahi","en":"(The) Promise of Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"حَقًّۭا ۚ","tr":"ḥaqqan","en":"(is) true","root":"حقق","lem":"حَقّ"},{"ar":"وَهُوَ","tr":"wahuwa","en":"And He"},{"ar":"ٱلْعَزِيزُ","tr":"l-ʿazīzu","en":"(is) the All-Mighty","root":"عزز","lem":"عَزِيز"},{"ar":"ٱلْحَكِيمُ","tr":"l-ḥakīmu","en":"the All-Wise","root":"حكم","lem":"حَكِيم"}]},{"n":10,"juz":21,"ar":"خَلَقَ ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ بِغَيْرِ عَمَدٍ تَرَوْنَهَا ۖ وَأَلْقَىٰ فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ رَوَٰسِىَ أَن تَمِيدَ بِكُمْ وَبَثَّ فِيهَا مِن كُلِّ دَآبَّةٍ ۚ وَأَنزَلْنَا مِنَ ٱلسَّمَآءِ مَآءً فَأَنۢبَتْنَا فِيهَا مِن كُلِّ زَوْجٍ كَرِيمٍ","en":"He created the heavens without pillars that you see and has cast into the earth firmly set mountains, lest it should shift with you, and dispersed therein from every creature. And We sent down rain from the sky and made grow therein [plants] of every noble kind.","w":[{"ar":"خَلَقَ","tr":"khalaqa","en":"He created","root":"خلق","lem":"خَلَقَ"},{"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","tr":"l-samāwāti","en":"the heavens","root":"سمو","lem":"سَماء"},{"ar":"بِغَيْرِ","tr":"bighayri","en":"without","root":"غير","lem":"غَيْر"},{"ar":"عَمَدٍۢ","tr":"ʿamadin","en":"pillars","root":"عمد","lem":"عَمَد"},{"ar":"تَرَوْنَهَا ۖ","tr":"tarawnahā","en":"that you see","root":"رأي","lem":"رَأَى"},{"ar":"وَأَلْقَىٰ","tr":"wa-alqā","en":"and has cast","root":"لقي","lem":"أَلْقَى"},{"ar":"فِى","tr":"fī","en":"in"},{"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","tr":"l-arḍi","en":"the earth","root":"أرض","lem":"أَرْض"},{"ar":"رَوَٰسِىَ","tr":"rawāsiya","en":"firm mountains","root":"رسو","lem":"رَواسِي"},{"ar":"أَن","tr":"an","en":"lest"},{"ar":"تَمِيدَ","tr":"tamīda","en":"it (might) shake","root":"ميد","lem":"تَمِيدَ"},{"ar":"بِكُمْ","tr":"bikum","en":"with you"},{"ar":"وَبَثَّ","tr":"wabatha","en":"and He dispersed","root":"بثث","lem":"بَثَّ"},{"ar":"فِيهَا","tr":"fīhā","en":"in it"},{"ar":"مِن","tr":"min","en":"from"},{"ar":"كُلِّ","tr":"kulli","en":"every","root":"كلل","lem":"كُلّ"},{"ar":"دَآبَّةٍۢ ۚ","tr":"dābbatin","en":"creature","root":"دبب","lem":"دابَّة"},{"ar":"وَأَنزَلْنَا","tr":"wa-anzalnā","en":"And We sent down","root":"نزل","lem":"أَنزَلَ"},{"ar":"مِنَ","tr":"mina","en":"from"},{"ar":"ٱلسَّمَآءِ","tr":"l-samāi","en":"the sky","root":"سمو","lem":"سَماء"},{"ar":"مَآءًۭ","tr":"māan","en":"water","root":"موه","lem":"ماء"},{"ar":"فَأَنۢبَتْنَا","tr":"fa-anbatnā","en":"then We caused to grow","root":"نبت","lem":"أَنۢبَتَ"},{"ar":"فِيهَا","tr":"fīhā","en":"therein"},{"ar":"مِن","tr":"min","en":"of"},{"ar":"كُلِّ","tr":"kulli","en":"every","root":"كلل","lem":"كُلّ"},{"ar":"زَوْجٍۢ","tr":"zawjin","en":"kind","root":"زوج","lem":"زَوْج"},{"ar":"كَرِيمٍ","tr":"karīmin","en":"noble","root":"كرم","lem":"كَرِيم"}]},{"n":11,"juz":21,"ar":"هَـٰذَا خَلْقُ ٱللَّهِ فَأَرُونِى مَاذَا خَلَقَ ٱلَّذِينَ مِن دُونِهِۦ ۚ بَلِ ٱلظَّـٰلِمُونَ فِى ضَلَـٰلٍ مُّبِينٍ","en":"This is the creation of Allāh. So show Me what those other than Him have created. Rather, the wrongdoers are in clear error.","w":[{"ar":"هَـٰذَا","tr":"hādhā","en":"This"},{"ar":"خَلْقُ","tr":"khalqu","en":"(is the) creation","r