nd not"},{"ar":"هُدًۭى","tr":"hudan","en":"guidance","root":"هدي","lem":"هُدًى"},{"ar":"وَلَا","tr":"walā","en":"and not"},{"ar":"كِتَـٰبٍۢ","tr":"kitābin","en":"a book","root":"كتب","lem":"كِتاب"},{"ar":"مُّنِيرٍۢ","tr":"munīrin","en":"enlightening","root":"نور","lem":"مُنِير"}]},{"n":21,"juz":21,"ar":"وَإِذَا قِيلَ لَهُمُ ٱتَّبِعُوا۟ مَآ أَنزَلَ ٱللَّهُ قَالُوا۟ بَلْ نَتَّبِعُ مَا وَجَدْنَا عَلَيْهِ ءَابَآءَنَآ ۚ أَوَلَوْ كَانَ ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنُ يَدْعُوهُمْ إِلَىٰ عَذَابِ ٱلسَّعِيرِ","en":"And when it is said to them, \"Follow what Allāh has revealed,\" they say, \"Rather, we will follow that upon which we found our fathers.\" Even if Satan was inviting them to the punishment of the Blaze?","w":[{"ar":"وَإِذَا","tr":"wa-idhā","en":"And when"},{"ar":"قِيلَ","tr":"qīla","en":"it is said","root":"قول","lem":"قالَ"},{"ar":"لَهُمُ","tr":"lahumu","en":"to them"},{"ar":"ٱتَّبِعُوا۟","tr":"ittabiʿū","en":"Follow","root":"تبع","lem":"اتَّبَعَ"},{"ar":"مَآ","tr":"mā","en":"what"},{"ar":"أَنزَلَ","tr":"anzala","en":"Allah (has) revealed","root":"نزل","lem":"أَنزَلَ"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","tr":"l-lahu","en":"Allah (has) revealed","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"قَالُوا۟","tr":"qālū","en":"they say","root":"قول","lem":"قالَ"},{"ar":"بَلْ","tr":"bal","en":"Nay"},{"ar":"نَتَّبِعُ","tr":"nattabiʿu","en":"we will follow","root":"تبع","lem":"اتَّبَعَ"},{"ar":"مَا","tr":"mā","en":"what"},{"ar":"وَجَدْنَا","tr":"wajadnā","en":"we found","root":"وجد","lem":"وَجَدَ"},{"ar":"عَلَيْهِ","tr":"ʿalayhi","en":"on it"},{"ar":"ءَابَآءَنَآ ۚ","tr":"ābāanā","en":"our forefathers","root":"أبو","lem":"آباء"},{"ar":"أَوَلَوْ","tr":"awalaw","en":"Even if"},{"ar":"كَانَ","tr":"kāna","en":"Shaitaan was","root":"كون","lem":"كانَ"},{"ar":"ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنُ","tr":"l-shayṭānu","en":"Shaitaan was","root":"شطن","lem":"شَيْطان"},{"ar":"يَدْعُوهُمْ","tr":"yadʿūhum","en":"(to) call them","root":"دعو","lem":"دَعا"},{"ar":"إِلَىٰ","tr":"ilā","en":"to"},{"ar":"عَذَابِ","tr":"ʿadhābi","en":"(the) punishment","root":"